flowchart LR
    A[Uncertainty Detected] --> B[Capture Evidence Package]
    B --> C[Correlation ID]
    B --> D[Policy Version]
    B --> E[State Snapshot]
    B --> F[Tool Trace]
    B --> G[Reason Code]

    B --> H[Route to Owner]
    H --> I{Decision}
    I -- Approve --> J[Proceed with Evidence]
    I -- Deny --> K[Refuse / Explain]
    I -- Defer --> L[Pending / More Evidence]
    J --> M[Replay Link]
    K --> M
    L --> M
